Herdr QuickMenu

The menu UI and manifest are derived from Herdr's shipped menu:
https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app/tree/034f8b85f7e6bb71f8ff55cb4a80c548b2578c0f/defaults/mods/menu
Herdr v0.1.16, commit 034f8b85f7e6bb71f8ff55cb4a80c548b2578c0f.
The installed shipped menu main.js was byte-identical to that upstream file.

Upstream license: Apache License 2.0 (included verbatim in LICENSE).
https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app/blob/034f8b85f7e6bb71f8ff55cb4a80c548b2578c0f/LICENSE
Upstream Cargo.toml declares Apache-2.0. The copied menu files have no
additional copyright notices or separate license. Modified files are marked.
The additions and documentation in this distribution use Apache-2.0 as well.
This is an unofficial community mod, not an endorsed Herdr product.

Modifications: selected URL and search actions; native clipboard dispatch;
clipboard extraction with KDE publication verification; local-folder validation and platform-specific file manager launch;
disabled/busy states; popup dimensions; tests and documentation.

Upstream THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES was inspected. This package does not bundle
Herdr, its native libraries, fonts, or icon files. It references icons from
the user's installed workspace-chrome mod. The actual menu screenshot
includes those rendered icons; their upstream notice is reproduced below.
Other upstream binary-dependency notices do not pertain to copied menu code.

